WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.440
Hey, take a look at this.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.350
What is it?

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.980
<b>A transfer student is arriving today from another village. 
Everyone be sure to be friendly. —Hana</b>

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.040
It says "transfer student"!

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.230
At this time of year?

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:08.500
Looks that way.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.280
Huh...

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.800
I wonder what she's like.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.530
I hope she's a lively girl.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.120
A quiet girl would be good, too.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.120
Maybe she...

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.040
turns out to be a he!

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.880
I just thought it might be interesting.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.420
No chance!

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.920
That would never happen.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:35.990
I'll say.

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:38.470
That did startle me a bit, though.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.610
Hey! Isn't that her?

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.370
Are you the transfer student?

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.650
Y-Yeah.

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:48.560
Why're you hiding?

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.070
Come on down!

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.860
Uh, I (Boku), um...

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:54.740
"Boku"?

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.130
What's "boku"?

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.240
Her name?

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.140
Got me.

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:04.620
I seem to recall, "boku" is 
a male first-person pronoun.

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:09.380
Male?

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:49.390
<b>The Transfer Student</b>

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:48.950
Tsubaki, reporting in.

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.560
Do you know about the transfer student?

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.800
Yes, ma'am. I read the sign.

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:54.810
I see.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:58.110
Does the fact that you summoned me mean...?

00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.890
I'm putting her in your Team Dog.

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.690
Make her feel at home.

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:02.160
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:06.180
Uh, so, what kind of girl is she?

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:12.180
She came from a village where men live.

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.540
Huh?

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:18.760
H-Huh?! Could that mean that 
the transfer student is m...

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:22.480
male, by any chance?

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.440
Of course it doesn't.

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:26.720
O-Of course!

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:29.520
The transfer student is a girl.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:33.370
Then that means she knows about men.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:37.020
<b>Akane Class</b>

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:37.020
Yes, and I want to avoid information 
reaching the other students.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:41.730
She's been told about our village's 
situation, but you never know.

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:45.090
Tsubaki, stick with her and help her.

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:45.880
I will!

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.650
Good. She's in your hands.

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:49.660
If you'll excuse me.

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:04.300
<i>A transfer student who knows about men!</i>

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:14.140
<i>No, no! I mustn't get carried away.</i>

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:18.950
What's going on?

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.510
Did something happen?

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:25.990
Oh, Tsubaki! As it turns out, 
we caught a man!

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:27.120
Huh?!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:30.820
What do you have to say for yourself, "man"?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.420
H-Hey, what's this "man" stuff?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.670
Isn't that the transfer student?

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:38.040
That's right.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.090
So why are you doing this?

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:43.170
Because, get this... 
The transfer student is male!

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.440
He said "boku."

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:48.390
And they say "boku" is how 
men refer to themselves.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.520
Say what?

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:02.610
Hey, Tsubaki! What do you think you're doing?!

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:05.540
Everybody calm down and think!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:08.030
There's no way the transfer student's male!

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.570
But he said "boku"!

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:14.020
If he's not male, show us some proof!

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.330
Yeah! You got any proof?!

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:21.900
Oh! Hey!

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:23.590
They ran for it!

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.840
Asagao

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:29.900
Are you all right?

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.870
Yeah. Th-Thank you.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.450
My name is Tsubaki.

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.690
May I ask what yours is?

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:43.650
R-Rindou. Nice to meet you.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:47.240
Yes, it's nice to meet you, too, Rindou.

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:50.020
You're in Team Dog?

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:52.450
Um, I'm supposed to be in it, too.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.870
Yes, I heard that from Sensei.

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:59.870
Um, I also know that you 
lived in a village with men.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.880
O-Okay.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:09.670
That's a lovely mask.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.750
Is it a fox mask?

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.220
Oh, yeah...

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:17.280
What brings you to this village, Rindou?

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:22.110
Uh, I've been shy ever since I was little.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:26.490
There aren't many boys in 
the village where I lived.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.110
I was raised as one.

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:34.960
But I wasn't growing up to be manly at all.

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:39.290
So ultimately, they decided 
to raise me as a girl.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:44.500
And they figured, why not place 
me in an all-women village?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.320
So, that's it.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:51.530
Sorry. It never occurred to me just 
saying "boku" would lead to all this.

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:53.260
There's no need to apologize.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:58.000
Saying boku is a habit 
from when I was raised male.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:02.190
It'll be fine. I'm going to help 
so that things turn out well.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.460
Thank you!

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:14.970
You're cute.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.870
I mean, really cute!

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:19.520
N-No way...

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:22.660
I've heard that men aren't cute!

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.190
Now you'll be fine!

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:26.090
Let's go see everyone!

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:27.880
H-Huh?!

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:31.970
Your attention, please!

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.230
Tsubaki! He's male, isn't he?

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:35.220
Hand him over!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.850
You're wrong.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.390
This is Rindou, a girl!

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:42.320
Then why did she say boku earlier?

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:46.940
Rindou has always been frail,

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.090
and because they wanted 
her to grow up strong,

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:53.360
she's been forced since she was 
little to use the masculine "boku"!

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:55.020
Say what?

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:56.120
Is that true?

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:58.910
So, do you have proof she's female?

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.850
There's proof, all right.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:04.450
Right here!

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:08.960
Um, Rindou?

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:12.670
I-I can't. I'm too shy!

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:16.730
Hey, what's the problem?

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.640
He's really a man, isn't he?

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.400
Take off the mask already!

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.400
R-Rindou, uh...

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:24.060
He's male after all, isn't he?

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:24.060
He is, isn't he?

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.130
Get on with it, already!

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:28.370
Why is the mask still on?

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:33.860
Eh?

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:34.700
Huh?

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.070
He dropped his pants?!

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.640
Wh-Why are you taking off clothing?

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.910
Tsubaki, lean in.

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:43.080
Hey, what's going on?

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.750
What're you talking about?

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:54.320
Uh, um...

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:59.760
A-Apparently, men have a stick-like 
thing attached to their crotch...

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:01.480
A stick on their crotch?

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:02.630
What's up with that?

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:07.390
Look closely. Rindou does not have one!

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:09.980
And it's called...

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:11.470
a ding-a-ling!

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.280
Or, apparently it is.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:17.110
Ding...

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:18.120
...a-ling?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.580
Ding-a-ling?

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:20.700
Ding-a-ling?

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:21.700
Ding-a-ling?

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.450
Ding-a-ling?

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:28.460
What's with that name?!

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:29.380
Weird!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.460
"Ding-a-ling," she said.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:33.780
I think someone got the 
"nin-nin" chant wrong.

00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:36.050
Ding-a-ling, huh?

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.410
I can't stop laughing!

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:39.220
Ding-a-ling!

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.400
Ding-a-ling!

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:43.930
Ding-a-ling!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.020
Ding-a-ling!

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.230
Ding-a-ling!

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:53.480
Ding-a-ling! Ding-a-ling!

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.710
Hey, is that true?

00:09:53.920 --> 00:10:00.570
Ding-a-ling! Ding-a-ling!

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:58.160
I have... heard mention of it.

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:07.370
Ding-a-ling! Ding-a-ling!

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:06.960
Rindou, was it?

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:09.460
Sorry for doubting you.

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:11.690
Oh, s'okay.

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:13.090
Sorry, Rindou.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.730
Let's be friends!

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.210
Which team are you joining?

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.560
How old are you?

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:19.720
Why are you wearing a mask?

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.460
Is something wrong?

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:25.280
She ran off somewhere.

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:27.360
Did she get mad, maybe?

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:30.560
We haven't even introduced ourselves!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.120
Rindou is very shy.

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:34.920
Then let's go find her!

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:35.820
Good idea.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.320
Which way did she go?

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.960
Maybe into the forest!

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:39.940
How about the fields?

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:41.720
We'll split up and search, then.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:44.710
Yeah! Ding-a-ling!

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:46.380
Ding-a-ling...

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:49.960
F-For some reason...

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:53.560
that's embarrassing!

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:58.720
<b>Shy Around Strangers</b>

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.800
<b>Team Dog</b>

00:10:57.440 --> 00:11:01.390
And so, this is Rindou, 
who's joining Team Dog.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.350
Let's all give it our best together.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:05.850
A transfer student!

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:08.230
Uh, n-nice to—

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.840
I'm Asagao! Nice to meet you!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:12.150
That's Sazanka.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.490
Nice to meet you, Sazanka.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:16.900
Oh...

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:18.280
Rindou.

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:21.360
May I give you a tour of our room?

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.660
Oh, sure.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.910
Let's see, first...

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:27.760
The futons are in here.

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:31.120
In Team Dog, we make it a 
practice to sleep side by side.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.910
As of today, it'll be the four of us!

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:34.850
Okay.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:38.980
Also, put your personal belongings in this.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:40.510
<b>Rindou</b>

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:41.000
I labeled it with your name.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:41.880
Thank you.

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:46.380
And then, tea implements are over here.

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:51.700
These hanging scrolls are 
in each team's room,

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:56.440
<b>Dog</b>

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:56.440
<b>A
k
a
n
e

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:56.440
and I heard some very distinguished person 
in the village made them long ago.

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:00.900
They were named, um, I think...

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:59.940
Tsubaki-chan seems happy.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:02.510
Oh, it's totally escaping me.

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:04.280
Why do you wear a mask?

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:06.480
Oh, uh, because...

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:08.780
Wh-What?

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:10.200
This sound!

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:12.390
It's the sound of dinner!

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:15.670
Time to eat.

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:15.670
Time to eat!

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:15.670
Time to eat...

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:19.630
<i>So the mouth part comes off...</i>

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:22.340
Hey, Rindou. Do you eat a lot?

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:27.180
You don't have to finish all yours. 
Especially fish, or meat.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:30.480
Hey! Bad manners, Asagao.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:32.770
Don't worry. I eat plenty.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:35.060
Oh, okay...

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.240
Tsubaki.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:40.650
Hi. This girl is Team Dog's transfer student?

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:43.020
Yes, this is Rindou.

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:44.680
Oh, um...

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:48.630
I'm Mokuren. Team Monkey. Nice to meet you.

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:49.790
Uh, yeah.

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:52.480
Team Monkey is the medical team.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:53.540
Is that so?

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:57.580
You can bring your troubles 
to me, not just your injuries.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.080
Thank you.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:01.340
Oh! Isn't that Rindou?

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.670
We couldn't find you anywhere earlier!

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:06.880
Are you good at hiding?

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:08.110
Where were you?

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:10.720
Why do you wear a mask even when you eat?

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:12.220
Hey, everyone!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:17.280
Enough yammering! I'm eating here.

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:18.940
Could you go somewhere else?

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.530
Huh?!

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:21.480
What's with you?!

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:22.640
We just want to talk a bit!

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:23.690
Hey, hey.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:28.600
A barrage of questions is 
overwhelming for Rindou.

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:30.750
Please let things settle down first.

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:33.670
Fine, then.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:35.330
We'll wait until next time.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:36.900
Phooey.

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:46.070
Uh, Sazanka.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:49.960
Were you all right?

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:52.260
Oh, yeah. Thank you.

00:13:57.720 --> 00:14:00.490
Wasn't dinner yummy, Rindou?

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:00.940
Yup.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.860
I grew the pickled daikon 
radish we had today.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.450
I'm raising all sorts of other veggies, too.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:08.930
Oh, really?

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:11.330
I'll show you around the fields tomorrow.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.330
Oh, I know.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.080
Hey, Tsubaki-chan.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:18.690
Now that Rindou's come and all, today 
let's bathe up in the mountains!

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:21.220
Good idea. Let's do that.

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:23.510
Up in the mountains?

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:33.730
Wow!

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:38.020
Yahoo!

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:43.040
Asagao! No leaping in. It's dangerous!

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.570
Big bath!

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:50.580
It's so warm.

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:53.450
Rindou, swim with me!

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.760
It's fun!

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:58.200
S-Sure! Later on.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:03.380
This bath is spacious, but it's 
far away, so we rarely come here.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.340
It's not very close to the village.

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:10.760
Ninja art:

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.180
Squirt Gun!

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:16.310
Why you!

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:26.610
Um...

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.850
I swear, that Asagao.

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:32.110
Oh, Sazanka. Where are you going?

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:34.700
Over to the hot section.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:43.720
This water sure is great.

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:44.570
Yeah.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:54.120
<i>Th-This might be my chance 
to ask Rindou about men.</i>

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:54.890
This is fun.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:55.830
Huh?

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:59.600
I was raised as a boy in the village,

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:02.690
so I couldn't bathe with girls.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:05.900
And I was too embarrassed 
to get in with the boys.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.530
So, it's fun getting to bathe 
with everyone like this.

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.200
Well, good for—

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:15.960
But it looks like Sazanka doesn't like me.

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:16.780
Huh?!

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:18.480
She's so huffy with me.

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:19.790
Oh, that's—

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:21.660
She doesn't dislike you!

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:24.810
You see, Sazanka's shy around strangers.

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:27.920
Once she gets to know you, 
she'll act totally conceited.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.360
Is that so?

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:33.380
Yes. So, it'll be fine 
once she's used to you.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:34.690
Huh...

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:36.000
Want me to go get her?

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:36.890
N-No!

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.320
I'll go to her.

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:53.190
Sazanka.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.960
Wh-What?

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:56.900
Uh, I...

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.080
want to be friends with you!

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.160
I'm shy around strangers, <i>too</i>.

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:08.920
Nobody ever said I was...

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:16.420
Tsubaki!

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:19.090
S-Sazanka is...!

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:25.720
Looks like the heat got to her.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:33.450
What now? We could go call Team Monkey, 
but it's so far away.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:35.240
That's true.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:38.040
Maybe she got stressed out because of me.

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:40.490
No, I'm sure that's not it.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.620
No, it's my fault.

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:45.880
I can tell, because I'm 
shy around strangers, too.

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:46.500
And so...

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.340
You mean, you can use medical Jutsu, too?

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.820
I can't.

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:56.960
But...

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.060
I can summon.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.370
Wow! What's that?!

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:08.780
Come Here Jutsu.

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:10.000
Come Here?

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:10.760
Mokuren.

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:11.650
Y-Yes?

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:17.020
I want you... to heal Sazanka.

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:22.410
Ouch!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.620
Be gentler!

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:27.200
Sorry.

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:29.690
Shouldn't you be thanking her, Sazanka?!

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:33.700
No, I just did my job. If you thank anyone...

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.500
thank Rindou.

00:18:48.340 --> 00:18:49.950
Can't you move?

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:52.650
Summoning... tires me out.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:06.740
Huh?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.800
Hey! Sazanka!

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:14.560
She's cute!

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.300
Wow!

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:17.860
G-Give it back!

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:24.000
You can move just fine.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.180
Rindou! Towel! Towel!

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:27.890
There we go.

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:32.230
I...

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:35.450
I'm shy about my face.

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:43.240
It's weird to be more shy about 
your face than about being naked!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:47.990
Well, that's the way I feel.

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:49.040
Ow.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:49.810
Come on!

00:19:56.790 --> 00:20:00.840
Th-Thank you... Rindou.

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:22.280
Sazanka is all better, 
so why don't we get back in?

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:25.100
Maybe I'll get in, too, then.

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:27.790
Yay! Let's all swim!

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:30.970
You're so childish, Asagao.

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:32.510
I want to swim, too.

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:34.970
Then, let's have a race, Rindou!

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:36.280
S-Sure!

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:10.450
<b>Tiger</b>

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:40.770
<b>Team Tiger</b>

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:52.700
<b>Secret
base</b>

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:14.400
All right, we're starting class.

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:15.890
Take your seats.

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:19.740
We'll start with a ninjutsu review.

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:23.280
Quiet down over there. And be seated.

00:22:23.280 --> 00:22:24.570
Yes, ma'am!

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:28.910
First we have Transformation Jutsu.

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:34.540
Next is Copy Jutsu.

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:37.960
This would be Fire Style Jutsu.

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:40.280
Onward we go.

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:44.170
Konoha-sensei! 
Housenka says her stomach hurts!

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:45.890
She may go to the bathroom.

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:48.590
Let's continue.

00:22:49.350 --> 00:22:50.970
Sleep Bell Jutsu.

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:54.010
Where the sound of a bell puts you to sleep.

00:22:54.320 --> 00:22:55.890
Shadow Bind Jutsu.

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:58.770
You step on someone's shadow 
to keep them from moving.

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:00.580
And, next...

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:03.970
Asagao.

00:23:04.410 --> 00:23:06.220
I'm sorry.

00:23:07.040 --> 00:23:08.990
Hang in there until lunch.

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:11.160
Loyalty Trance Jutsu.

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:13.700
Don't use this one irresponsibly.

00:23:14.170 --> 00:23:15.330
Dancing Leaves Jutsu.

00:23:15.840 --> 00:23:18.530
You're a bagworm before you know it.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:20.920
The "whap" thing.

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:23.790
Well, this needs no explanation.

00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:26.880
That's all. How many have you memorized?

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:27.890
Three!

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:29.040
I knew them all!

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:29.040
Five!

00:23:29.040 --> 00:23:30.510
See you next time, then.

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:32.880
Tsubaki-chan?!

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:32.880
Huh?!

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:33.900
No way!

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:33.900
Nee-sama?!

00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:35.970
Be sure to learn them by heart!

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next time:

00:23:37.990 --> 00:23:39.180
To be continued!
